{"release":"06c989076142","id":"M048","name":"PAHT-CF","noProduct":false,"fullName":"Carbon-Fiber-Reinforced High-Temperature Polyamide","family":"Nylon / Polyamide","filler":"Carbon fibre","polymer":"PAHT","h2cStatus":"Official Bambu product","kind":{"basePolymer":"PAHT","fibre":true,"flexible":false,"foaming":false,"variantClass":false,"support":false,"esd":false,"beyond":false,"morphology":"semicrystalline","printedState":"crystalline","group":"aliphatic polyamide"},"bestUses":null,"limitations":null,"notes":[],"guidance":[],"summary":{"text":"PAHT-CF is a carbon-fibre-filled high-temperature polyamide. A maker suggests it for functional prototypes, machining fixtures, injection moulds and jigs. Semicrystalline, it carries light load well above its glass transition, and its HDT at 0.45 MPa is 145 °C. Across the layers it keeps 24 % of its flat tensile strength, and on the H2C it needs a hardened nozzle and drying.","parts":[{"text":"PAHT-CF","field":"name","key":"name","stat":null},{"text":" is a carbon-fibre-filled high-temperature polyamide. A maker suggests it for functional prototypes, machining fixtures, injection moulds and jigs. Semicrystalline, it carries light load well above its glass transition, and its "},{"text":"HDT at 0.45 MPa","field":"hdt045.label","key":"hdt045","stat":"label"},{"text":" is "},{"text":"145 °C","field":"hdt045.range","key":"hdt045","stat":"range"},{"text":". Across the layers it keeps "},{"text":"24 %","field":"zshare.tensileStrength","key":"zshare","stat":"tensileStrength"},{"text":" of its flat tensile strength, and on the H2C it needs a hardened nozzle and drying."}],"by":"Claude Sonnet (agent), revised by Claude Opus (agent)","on":"2026-10-17","status":"draft"},"identityNote":null,"categoryWords":{"application":"Application notes","print-quality":"Print quality","post-processing":"Post-processing","specimen-prep":"Specimen preparation","safety":"Safety","circularity":"Disposal and circularity","limitations":"Stated limitation