XY Flat"},{"key":"izodNotched","id":"V002486","value":4.9,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","page":4,"twin":null,"admitted":["treatment"],"at":"Impact Strength Izod (notched), print direction XY Flat"},{"key":"hdt045","id":"V002464","value":145,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","page":3,"twin":null,"admitted":["treatment"],"at":"HDT at 0.45 MPa (dry)"},{"key":"hdt18","id":"V002463","value":92,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","page":3,"twin":null,"admitted":["treatment"],"at":"HDT at 1.8 MPa (dry)"},{"key":"glassTransition","id":"V007637","value":70,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","page":7,"twin":null,"admitted":["moisture"],"at":"Glass Transition ISO 11357-2"},{"key":"shoreD","id":"V007641","value":72,"mark":"counted","why":null,"annealed":null,"source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","page":7,"twin":null,"at":"Shore Hardness D (15s) DIN ISO 7619-1"}],"listings":[],"held":[],"replaced":[],"print":{"nozzle":{"verdict":"within","state":"range","min":260,"max":280,"profileId":"P0732"},"bed":{"verdict":"within","state":"range","min":100,"max":120,"profileId":"P0732"},"chamber":{"verdict":"within","state":"enclosed","min":null,"max":null,"profileId":null},"enclosure":"recommended","drying":{"need":"required","c":[null,80],"h":[4,16],"hoursOpen":false,"profileId":"P0732"},"hardened":true,"anneal":[{"c":90,"h":2}],"advice":null,"from":{"chamber":{"kind":"guide","said":"the Bambu Lab Filament Guide"}},"profileIds":["P0732","P1654"],"fromId":{"chamber":"PG029","enclosure":"PG029"}},"price":null,"notes":[{"topic":"Good for","items":[{"id":"Q06753","text":"Ultrafuse® PAHT CF15 is a high-performance 3D printing filament that opens new application fields in FFF printing.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q03410","text":"strong | chemical resistant | ESD safe","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q03411","text":"Advanced heat resistant material with very good processability and ESD properties.","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 3","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06754","text":"In parallel to its advanced mechanical properties, dimensional stability, and chemical resistance, it has very good processability.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06757","text":"Ultrafuse® PAHT CF15 offers high temperature resistance, low moisture absorption","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Precision and tolerance","items":[{"id":"Q03413","text":"The annealing process can lead to a minor deviation in the dimensional accuracy.","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 4","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Moisture sensitivity","items":[{"id":"Q06758","text":"Ultrafuse® PAHT CF15 filament should be stored at 15 - 25°C in its originally sealed package in a clean and dry environment.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06759","text":"If the recommended storage conditions are observed the products will have a minimum shelf life of 12 months.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06761","text":"80 °C in a hot air dryer or vacuum oven for at least 4 to 16 hours.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Nozzle wear","items":[{"id":"Q03412","text":"Nozzle Diameter ≥ 0,6 mm, hardened","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 3","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06755","text":"It works in any FFF printer with a hardened nozzle.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06763","text":"Nozzle Diameter ≥ 0,6 mm, Ruby or hardened","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Odour and emissions","items":[{"id":"Q06760","text":"Recommended: Process materials in a well ventilated room, or use professional extraction systems.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Supports and removal","items":[{"id":"Q03414","text":"Support material Single material breakaway, Ultrafuse BVOH","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 4","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06756","text":"In addition to that, it is compatible with water-soluble support material and HiPS, which allow printing complex geometries that work in challenging environments.","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06764","text":"Support material compatibility Single material breakaway, Ultrafuse® BVOH, Ultrafuse® HIPS","source":"R-FORWARDAM-PAHT-CF15-TDS-v4-0","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Printing advice","items":[{"id":"Q03415","text":"Fix larger parts to avoid potential deformation during the annealing process.","source":"R-BASF-ExtendedTDS-Ultrafuse-PAHT-CF15-V1-5","at":"p. 4","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06762","text":"Bed Material PEI or 